        <mxCell id="t2icTqTPWBVXEE8vvvQf-36" connectable="0" parent="t2icTqTPWBVXEE8vvvQf-35" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="Send Email with&lt;div&gt;information + if charge failed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;the stripe payment link&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.2325" y="-2" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2icTqTPWBVXEE8vvvQf-41" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Owner-user submits the invite.&lt;/strong&gt; In the admin dashboard, the owner-user types the new staff member's email (and whatever else you want, like a name or which group they belong to), hits submit. The frontend sends this to an API endpoint protected by Cognito — it checks the owner-user's own access token and confirms they're actually in the &lt;code&gt;owner_user&lt;/code&gt; group (and the token's &lt;code&gt;tenant_id&lt;/code&gt; claim) before letting the request through.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;ManageUserFn&lt;/code&gt; creates the account.&lt;/strong&gt; This Lambda calls Cognito's &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;AdminCreateUser&lt;/code&gt; with the new email and &lt;code&gt;custom:tenant_id&lt;/code&gt; = the caller's tenant (immutable). Cognito generates a temporary password behind the scenes and puts the account in a &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;FORCE_CHANGE_PASSWORD&lt;/code&gt; state — it exists, but can't be used normally yet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;ManageUserFn&lt;/code&gt; assigns their role.&lt;/strong&gt; A second call, &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;AdminAddUserToGroup&lt;/code&gt;, puts them into &lt;code&gt;staff_user&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;owner_user&lt;/code&gt; — whichever the owner-user selected. Without this step they'd have an account but no permissions tied to it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Cognito sends the invite email automatically.&lt;/strong&gt; By default (&lt;code&gt;cognito_invites_via_ses = false&lt;/code&gt;, the current dev/prod setting) this is Cognito's built-in sender, capped at &lt;b&gt;50 emails/day&lt;/b&gt;. Setting &lt;code&gt;cognito_invites_via_ses = true&lt;/code&gt; switches invites and password resets to the platform's SES identity (&lt;code&gt;email_sending_account = DEVELOPER&lt;/code&gt;, your own sender address, no daily cap - needs SES production access). Either way, &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;AdminCreateUser&lt;/code&gt; triggers the email itself — no separate &quot;send email&quot; code needed. The email contains their username (their email address) and the temporary password, filled into whatever subject/body template you've configured on the user pool. The template (&lt;code&gt;invite_message_template&lt;/code&gt; in Terraform) carries the admin app URL (&lt;code&gt;admin_app_url&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;code&gt;app.&amp;lt;platform domain&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;, or the CloudFront domain until a platform domain is set).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. The new staff member clicks the link and logs in with the temp password.&lt;/strong&gt; They land on your app's normal login screen (not a Cognito-hosted page — there isn't one), enter their email and the temporary password, and the frontend sends this to &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;ManageAuthFn&lt;/code&gt;'s login call (&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;InitiateAuth&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Cognito rejects it — on purpose — with a &quot;set a new password&quot; challenge.&lt;/strong&gt; Because the account is still &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;FORCE_CHANGE_PASSWORD&lt;/code&gt;, Cognito doesn't log them in yet. It responds with a &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;NEW_PASSWORD_REQUIRED&lt;/code&gt; challenge instead of tokens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. The frontend shows a &quot;choose your password&quot; form.&lt;/strong&gt; This is the actual moment that functions as &quot;registration&quot; in this system — there's no separate sign-up form, it's this challenge response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8. &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;ManageAuthFn&lt;/code&gt; completes the challenge.&lt;/strong&gt; The new password they typed gets sent via &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;RespondToAuthChallenge&lt;/code&gt;. Cognito validates it, permanently sets it as their real password, and flips the account to fully &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;CONFIRMED&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9. They're logged in immediately.&lt;/strong&gt; That same &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;RespondToAuthChallenge&lt;/code&gt; response hands back real access/ID/refresh tokens — no extra login step required. From this point on, they log in normally with their email and the password they just chose.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;So the whole thing rides on two Lambdas doing very specific jobs: &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;ManageUserFn&lt;/code&gt; only ever touches the &lt;em&gt;creation&lt;/em&gt; side (account + group), and &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;ManageAuthFn&lt;/code&gt; owns everything about &lt;em&gt;authenticating&lt;/em&gt; — including the one-time password-reset challenge that doubles as account activation.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="930" width="560" x="-880" y="-3810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2icTqTPWBVXEE8vvvQf-42" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 55px;&quot;&gt;COGNITO NEW USER PROCESS&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="490" x="-860" y="-4020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2icTqTPWBVXEE8vvvQf-43" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;User&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;(staff / owner, per tenant) — DynamoDB&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;Directory of every tenant's internal users. Staff are scoped to one location; owner-users to all of their tenant's locations. Every profile carries &lt;code&gt;tenantId&lt;/code&gt;. Mirrors Cognito identities for listing/editing; Cognito remains the auth source of truth. Keyed by &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;cognitoSub&lt;/code&gt; rather than location, since the frequent operation is &quot;look up the calling user's role/location from their token&quot; (used by &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;BlockTableFn&lt;/code&gt; and anything else doing per-request authorization) — a direct &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;GetItem&lt;/code&gt;, no &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;Query&lt;/code&gt;, no GSI. Listing a tenant's users (and suspending/offboarding a tenant) is a Query on the &lt;code&gt;byTenant&lt;/code&gt; GSI (HASH tenantId, RANGE PK) - never a Scan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;overflow-x-auto w-full px-2 mb-6 print:overflow-x-visible&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;min-w-full border-collapse text-sm leading-[1.7] whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;thead class=&quot;text-left&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; class=&quot;text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold&quot;&gt;Attribute&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; class=&quot;text-text-100 border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.6)] py-2 pr-4 align-top font-bold&quot;&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;PK (&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;USER#&amp;lt;cognitoSub&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;SK (&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;PROFILE&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;cognitoSub&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;role&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String (&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;staff&lt;/code&gt;|&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;owner_user&lt;/code&gt;|&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;super_admin&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;locationId&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String (empty for &lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;owner_user&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;super_admin&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;name&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;email&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;phone&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;status&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String (&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;active&lt;/code&gt;|&lt;code class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;disabled&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;createdBy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;createdAt&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;border-b-0.5 border-[hsl(var(--border-300)/0.3)] py-2 pr-4 align-top&quot;&gt;String (ISO8601)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
