nant_id&lt;/code&gt; claim (JWT routes) or from the location (public routes), never from the request&lt;br&gt;• shared IAM policy &lt;code&gt;tenant-context-read&lt;/code&gt;: GetItem/Query on the tenant table, Query on location &lt;code&gt;byLocationId&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;• only &lt;code&gt;active&lt;/code&gt; tenants served; plan features + maxLocations enforced (create-location: conditional transaction on locationCount)&lt;br&gt;• Stripe: every call with &lt;code&gt;Stripe-Account&lt;/code&gt; = the restaurant's connected account; webhooks are Connect endpoints (&lt;code&gt;event.account&lt;/code&gt; → tenant)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="-1520" y="-1700" width="380" height="230" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="saas-93" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="-1700" y="-1340" width="2650" height="760" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="saas-94" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=16;fontColor=#8C4FFF;" value="Tenant websites + platform domain - created only when var.platform_domain is set (count = 0 until then)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="-1680" y="-1335" width="1100" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="saas-95" parent="1" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#232F3D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.user;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="-1660" y="-1000" width="60" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="saas-96" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" value="guests&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;slug&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;domain&amp;gt; / www.restaurang.se" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="-1700" y="-938" width="140" height="44" as="geometry